v1.1 (2026-10-02):
- Updated to latest Clarivate JCR 2026 ranking database (22,600+ journals across SCIE, SSCI, AHCI, ESCI).
- Added multi-category percentiles, ranks, and subject breakdown in hover tooltips.
- Implemented smart Q-ranking fallback mechanism (Scopus SJR -> Clarivate JCR).
- Harmonized 100% of color palette between Impact Factor and Quartiles (unified Q2 tier for IF 3.0 - 5.0).
- Added network timeouts and anti-spin safeguards to eliminate infinite spinners.
- Added MutationObserver and debounced scroll listeners for infinite scroll support on Google Scholar.
- Updated preview screenshots in README with live Google Scholar search interface.

v1.0:
- Initial release with SJR, VHB, CCF, CORE on Google Scholar.
